# IAP offer popups (named)

All of these use **`IapOfferPopup`** (`components/IapOfferPopup.tsx`) — premium top band + header ring (not the post-purchase **`PurchaseSuccessfulPopup`**, which stays plain cream). **Starter Pack popup** uses purple band / `popup_header_purple.png`. **Remove Ads popup** uses red band (`#eb5761` fill, `#d33d57` wide stroke), `popup_header_red.png`, title `#af233a`, and a vertical shell nudge in `App.tsx`.

| Name (when talking to the AI) | `offerId` constant | `offers.ts` row |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Starter Pack popup** | `STORE_IAP_OFFER_STARTER_PACK_ID` | `STORE_BUNDLE_OFFERS` starter bundle |
| **Remove Ads popup** | `STORE_IAP_OFFER_REMOVE_ADS_ID` | `STORE_COIN_OFFERS` Remove Ads (7d, same price/icon as store small row) |

- **State:** `iapOfferUi` in `App.tsx` — `setIapOfferUi({ offerId: … })`.
- **Farm:** Starter floating button → Starter Pack popup; NO ADS floating button → Remove Ads popup.
- **Leaf burst:** Starter Pack uses `particle_leaf_11` / `12`; Remove Ads uses `particle_leaf_9` / `10` (`IapOfferPopup` `leafBurstVariant`).
